'''Hunter''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 7th tier in the Team Rewards during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The entire knife, from the handle to the blade is wrapped in bandages colored in zombie type-themes (Green, Brown, and Gray) while the top of the blade is uncovered with red eyes emitting from it. 

==Trivia==
*This knife was unobtainable for a short period of time due to the [[Candy Corn Gun (2022)|Candy Corn]] gun taking the place of this knife in the Team Rewards upon the release of the event. However, this issue was resolved on October 18th, 2022.
